  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "1. Open VRChat\n\n2. Open Menu\n\n3. Select Worlds\n\n4. Choose \"My worlds\" (I had 3 saved searches in my case)\n\n5. Select a saved search\n\n6. Select a world, nothing will happen\n\n7. If you now close the menu, you're stuck\n\nYou cannot walk anymore, you cannot open the menu anymore - you can only mute yourself and unmute. You're essentially stuck.\n\nYou can salvage it while you're still in the menu after 6 by opening your profile or similar things - once the menu is closed it's \"session over\".\n\n[Tested on Quest 3 via Virtual Desktop]",
